{"seq":1,"slug":"logic-tensor-networks","title":"逻辑张量网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/neuro-symbolic-ai/architectures/logic-tensor-networks","wordCount":1544,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"逻辑张量网络\">逻辑张量网络</h1><p>假设你在训练一个图像分类器，同时手里有一条领域知识：「猫是哺乳动物」。怎么让网络在学图片的同时，被强制相信「凡是被判为猫的，也该被判为哺乳动物」？逻辑张量网络（Logic Tensor Networks，LTN）给出的答案干净得近乎优雅：把这条逻辑规则翻译成一个介于 0 和 1 之间的「满足度」数值，然后让网络去最大化它——逻辑约束就这样变成了一个可以反向传播的优化目标。LTN 由 Serafini 与 Garcez 提出，并在 Sony AI 等机构持续发展，是「把符号塞进损失函数」最具代表性的范式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>LTN 的整个机制建立在一个叫<strong>真实逻辑</strong>（Real Logic）的语义上：它把一阶逻辑里的每个语法成分都映射到实数张量空间里的一个可微对象。这个映射过程称为<strong>接地</strong>（grounding）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[一阶逻辑公式&lt;br/&gt;forall x 猫of x 蕴含 哺乳of x] --&gt; B[接地 grounding]&#10;    B --&gt; C[常量接地为向量&lt;br/&gt;个体映射到嵌入]&#10;    B --&gt; D[谓词接地为神经网络&lt;br/&gt;输出 0 到 1 真值]&#10;    B --&gt; E[连接词接地为 t范数&lt;br/&gt;与 或 非 蕴含]&#10;    B --&gt; F[量词接地为聚合&lt;br/&gt;forall 用 p均值]&#10;    C --&gt; G[公式满足度&lt;br/&gt;一个 0 到 1 的标量]&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[最大化满足度&lt;br/&gt;反向传播训练]\">flowchart TD\n    A[一阶逻辑公式&lt;br/&gt;forall x 猫of x 蕴含 哺乳of x] --&gt; B[接地 grounding]\n    B --&gt; C[常量接地为向量&lt;br/&gt;个体映射到嵌入]\n    B --&gt; D[谓词接地为神经网络&lt;br/&gt;输出 0 到 1 真值]\n    B --&gt; E[连接词接地为 t范数&lt;br/&gt;与 或 非 蕴含]\n    B --&gt; F[量词接地为聚合&lt;br/&gt;forall 用 p均值]\n    C --&gt; G[公式满足度&lt;br/&gt;一个 0 到 1 的标量]\n    D --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[最大化满足度&lt;br/&gt;反向传播训练]</pre><p>具体而言：每个<strong>常量</strong>（个体）接地为一个实值向量（嵌入）；每个<strong>谓词</strong>接地为一个神经网络，输入个体的嵌入、输出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 的真值分数；每个<strong>逻辑连接词</strong>接地为模糊逻辑的 t-范数运算；每个<strong>量词</strong>接地为对一批个体真值的聚合函数。这样，一条完整的逻辑公式最终被接地为一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 的标量——它的满足度。训练目标就是调整所有嵌入与谓词网络的参数，使知识库里全部公式的满足度尽可能高。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从布尔到可微-t-范数的作用\">从布尔到可微：t-范数的作用</h2><p>LTN 能工作的数学核心，是用模糊逻辑的算子替换布尔算子，让真值连续可导。这套软真值的基础在 <a href=\"../foundations/symbolic-reasoning\">符号推理与知识表示</a> 已经铺垫，这里看它如何落地为具体公式。</p>\n<p>常用的是 Łukasiewicz 与 Product 两套 t-范数。以否定、合取、蕴含为例：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\neg a = 1 - a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">¬</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>⊗</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Łukasiewicz 合取</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a \\otimes b = \\max(0,\\; a + b - 1) \\quad (\\text{Łukasiewicz 合取})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord latin_fallback\">Ł</span><span class=\"mord\">ukasiewicz </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">合取</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Łukasiewicz 蕴含</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a \\Rightarrow b = \\min(1,\\; 1 - a + b) \\quad (\\text{Łukasiewicz 蕴含})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord latin_fallback\">Ł</span><span class=\"mord\">ukasiewicz </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">蕴含</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这些函数处处（几乎）可导，梯度能顺利穿过。全称量词 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span></span></span></span></span> 则接地为对一批个体真值的「p-均值」聚合，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 越大越接近取最小值（即越严格地要求「所有个体都满足」），从而在「软」与「硬」之间提供一个可调旋钮。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个完整例子-约束分类器\">一个完整例子：约束分类器</h2><p>回到开头的例子。设有谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Cat</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Cat}(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cat</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Mammal</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Mammal}(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Mammal</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，各由一个小神经网络实现。我们有两类知识：来自数据的事实（这张图是猫：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Cat</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>img</mtext><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Cat}(\\text{img}_1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cat</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">img</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 应接近 1），和来自领域的规则（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext> Cat</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⇒</mo><mtext>Mammal</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall x.\\ \\text{Cat}(x) \\Rightarrow \\text{Mammal}(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cat</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Mammal</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>）。</p>\n<p>用伪代码勾勒这套接地与训练目标，机制一目了然：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# 谓词接地为神经网络，输出 [0,1]&#10;Cat    = NeuralNet(out_dim=1, activation=sigmoid)&#10;Mammal = NeuralNet(out_dim=1, activation=sigmoid)&#10;&#10;# 知识库 = 数据事实 + 领域规则&#10;axioms = [&#10;    Cat(img1),                              # 数据事实：img1 是猫&#10;    Forall(x, Implies(Cat(x), Mammal(x))),  # 领域规则&#10;]&#10;&#10;# 训练：最大化所有公式满足度的聚合（用 t-范数与 p-均值实现）&#10;loss = 1 - aggregate([sat(a) for a in axioms])&#10;loss.backward()   # 梯度同时穿过谓词网络与嵌入\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 谓词接地为神经网络，输出 [0,1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Cat    = NeuralNet(out_dim=1, activation=sigmoid)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Mammal = NeuralNet(out_dim=1, activation=sigmoid)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 知识库 = 数据事实 + 领域规则</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>axioms = [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Cat(img1),                              # 数据事实：img1 是猫</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Forall(x, Implies(Cat(x), Mammal(x))),  # 领域规则</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 训练：最大化所有公式满足度的聚合（用 t-范数与 p-均值实现）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>loss = 1 - aggregate([sat(a) for a in axioms])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>loss.backward()   # 梯度同时穿过谓词网络与嵌入</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把二者都写进知识库，LTN 的总目标是最大化所有公式满足度的聚合。优化时，数据事实拉动谓词网络去拟合标注，逻辑规则则施加一个额外的梯度压力：每当网络把某物判为猫却不判为哺乳动物，蕴含式的满足度下降，反传回来的梯度就纠正这种不一致。规则因此成了一种「软约束」——不是事后过滤，而是从训练第一步就塑造网络的决策边界。「把约束放进训练」只是知识注入的一种放法；它与架构层、解码层注入在保证强度与成本上如何取舍，<a href=\"../reasoning/knowledge-injection\">知识注入与约束</a> 给出了三层谱系的系统对照。</p>\n<p>下表对比 LTN 在不同任务上扮演的角色，说明它不止于分类。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>任务</th>\n<th>数据事实</th>\n<th>逻辑约束</th>\n<th>LTN 带来的收益</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>半监督分类</td>\n<td>少量标注样本</td>\n<td>类别间的本体规则</td>\n<td>用规则弥补标注稀缺</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关系学习</td>\n<td>已知部分关系三元组</td>\n<td>关系的传递性/对称性</td>\n<td>推断缺失关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>知识图谱补全</td>\n<td>观测到的边</td>\n<td>规则模板</td>\n<td>软化的链接预测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌入学习</td>\n<td>相似度对</td>\n<td>等价/互斥约束</td>\n<td>嵌入空间更符合语义</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"ltn-在融合谱系中的位置与边界\">LTN 在融合谱系中的位置与边界</h2><p>按 <a href=\"../foundations/integration-taxonomy\">融合范式分类</a> 的坐标系，LTN 属于「神经＋符号」深度交织一类，对应 Kautz 第 5 型——符号被嵌入神经的内部结构，逻辑与学习浑然一体、端到端可微。它与同属可微一脉的概率方法（如 DeepProbLog）的关键差异在于：LTN 用<strong>模糊真值</strong>（程度），概率方法用<strong>概率</strong>（可能性），二者的语义、聚合方式与适用场景都不同，完整对照见 <a href=\"differentiable-reasoning\">可微分推理与软逻辑</a>。</p>\n<p>LTN 也有真实的边界。其一是<strong>扩展性</strong>：当个体数量巨大、量词需要遍历大批样本时，满足度计算与梯度成本陡增。其二是<strong>t-范数的选择敏感</strong>：不同 t-范数会产生不同甚至病态的梯度（例如某些合取在一端梯度消失），需要工程经验调试。2025 年 11 月发表的一项用 LTN 做可解释糖尿病预测的工作，正是把专家医学规则写成带可学习阈值的逻辑公理，印证了 LTN 在「规则即约束、且要可解释」的中等规模场景里的实用价值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>LTN 通过「接地」把一阶逻辑的每个成分映射为可微对象：常量→向量、谓词→神经网络、连接词→t-范数、量词→聚合，公式最终变成一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 的满足度标量。</li>\n<li>训练即最大化知识库全部公式的满足度，逻辑规则因此成为从第一步就塑造决策边界的软约束，而非事后过滤。</li>\n<li>数学核心是用模糊 t-范数替换布尔算子，使真值连续可导；p-均值聚合为量词提供「软硬可调」的旋钮。</li>\n<li>LTN 属「神经＋符号」/ Kautz 第 5 型，与概率方法的根本差异是用模糊真值而非概率。</li>\n<li>主要边界是大规模个体下的扩展性，以及 t-范数选择对梯度的敏感性。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"逻辑张量网络","id":"逻辑张量网络"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从布尔到可微：t-范数的作用","id":"从布尔到可微-t-范数的作用"},{"level":2,"text":"一个完整例子：约束分类器","id":"一个完整例子-约束分类器"},{"level":2,"text":"LTN 在融合谱系中的位置与边界","id":"ltn-在融合谱系中的位置与边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"融合范式分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/neuro-symbolic-ai/foundations/integration-taxonomy"},"next":{"title":"可微分推理与软逻辑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/neuro-symbolic-ai/architectures/differentiable-reasoning"}}